<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hyundai Motor, 11 affiliates on strike.</title>
<headline>Hyundai Motor, 11 affiliates on strike.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hyundai Motor Co Ltd and eleven other firms affiliated with South Korea's Hyundai Group were on strike on Monday, a group union official said.  </p>
<p>Later, the official said a 13th Hyundai affiliate was also on strike.</p>
<p>&quot;Hyundai Motor and the other unions were on indefinite strikes as of 8:30 a.m. (2330 GMT Sunday),&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>This affected 73,341 union workers, she added.</p>
<p>Hyundai Group has 20 unions in total.</p>
<p>Among the unions on strike were Hyundai Precision and Industry Co Ltd, Hyundai Motor Service Co Ltd and Hyundai Mipo Dock Yard Co Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
